-- kind: org
-- The treasury A_G is a Book account, not a cell field, so today NO law sees a treasury payout. Two halves:
--   (a) capability: the treasurer's office is a delegation of transfer on A_G with maxDelta
--       (offices.json; NEEDS K-FIELDS for maxDelta, and a delegate shape that can target an account);
--   (b) law: this file, appended to law.org when K-BOOK-SLOTS projects the Book leg of a command into the
--       org cell's law (joint/target/{BOOK}/balance/{A_G}/{GOLD}/delta; PLACE's name, ASSUMED).
-- A payout command's targets: 0 = this org cell (observe), plus the Book leg.
-- 7 treasury [J-MUD-5 rows 3, 4, 5]: gold leaves A_G only on a turn signed by the office holder recorded here,
--   at most MAXPAY per turn ({MAXPAY_LT} = -(MAXPAY+1)). NEEDS K-BOOK-SLOTS.
any [ slot joint/target/{BOOK}/balance/{A_G}/{GOLD}/delta == 0,
      all [ eqSlots subject field treasurer,
            not (slot joint/target/{BOOK}/balance/{A_G}/{GOLD}/delta <= {MAXPAY_LT}) ] ]
